   ]
  },
  "bio": [
   {
    "text": "In the past, Arashin was an Abzan fortress-city with heavy defenses against aerial attack, and it is also described as the largest Dromoka city and the greatest aerie, where Dromoka roosts.",
    "cites": [
     "p:stories/planeswalkers-guide-fate-reforged-2015-01-07",
     "p:stories/planeswalkers-guide-dragons-tarkir-part-2-2015-03-18",
     "planeswalkers-guide-dragons-tarkir-part-2-2015-03-18-r11"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/planeswalkers-guide-fate-reforged-2015-01-07",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/planeswalkers-guide-dragons-tarkir-part-2-2015-03-18",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/planeswalkers-guide-dragons-tarkir-part-2-2015-03-18#:~:text=Economically%2C%20politically%2C%20and%20militarily%2C,center%20of%20the%20clan."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "In Tarkir: Dragonstorm, Abzan outriders arrest Narset and Elspeth near the stormplains and take them to Arashin for questioning.",
    "cites": [
     "tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-4-heart-of-fire-e3"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-4-heart-of-fire#:~:text=Incarceration%20by%20the%20Abzan,part%20of%20Narset%27s%20plan."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Khan Felothar receives them before the Council of Houses and insists on lengthy hospitality, delaying their mission, while the house heads squabble.",
    "cites": [
     "tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-4-heart-of-fire-e8",
     "tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-4-heart-of-fire-e9"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-4-heart-of-fire#:~:text=We%20have%20all%20the%20time%20in%20the%20world.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-4-heart-of-fire#:~:text=we%20were%20told%20by,find%20in%20the%20dragonstorms."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Ajani bursts into the chamber to report that Sarkhan has taken control of the wild dragons at the borders, and he and Elspeth are reunited.",
    "cites": [
     "tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-4-heart-of-fire-e10",
     "tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-4-heart-of-fire-e11"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-4-heart-of-fire#:~:text=Sarkhan%20Vol%20has%20taken,dragons%20at%20the%20borders.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-4-heart-of-fire#:~:text=She%20died%20saving%20me%2C"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Felothar then frees the three and announces the evacuation and fortification of Arashin, though the council doubts Narset's warning that Sarkhan could bring thousands of dragons against it.",
    "cites": [
     "tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-5-recursion-e1",
     "tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-5-recursion-e2"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-5-recursion#:~:text=You%20three%20are%20free%20to%20go.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-5-recursion#:~:text=It%20will%20be%20thousands%20of%20dragons."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Nur arrives and confirms that hundreds of dragons are already in Sarkhan's army, and Felothar declares the Abzan will focus on preparation and dismisses the visitors with supplies.",
    "cites": [
     "tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-5-recursion-e3",
     "tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-5-recursion-e4"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-5-recursion#:~:text=My%20scouts%20report%20there,dragons%20in%20Sarkhan%27s%20army.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-episode-5-recursion#:~:text=You%20will%20be%20provisioned,whatever%20you%20might%20need."
    ]
   }
  ],
  "status": {
   "text": "As of Episode 5, Arashin's fortifications are being raised against the dragon threat and the Abzan are preparing for Sarkhan's dragons.",
